  <entry>
    <title>告警通知扩展到钉钉和短信：多通道路由、Token 缓存与失败隔离</title>
    <link href="https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/08/10/multi-channel-alarm-notification/"/>
    <id>https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/08/10/multi-channel-alarm-notification/</id>
