  <entry>
    <title>告警规则任务级化：从「全类型共享一条规则」到「每个任务各管各的」</title>
    <link href="https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/08/06/alarm-rule-task-level/"/>
    <id>https://zhlifeiy.codes/2026/08/06/alarm-rule-task-level/</id>
    <published>2026-08-06T11:30:00.000Z</published>
